OL,3,GNEWSAVisitor numbers climb after #8m
OL,4,Amarket makeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FA revamped outdoor market has attracted
OL,7,Fmore shoppers since reopening after an
OL,8,F#8m redevelopment, although some
OL,9,Ftraders say customers still have
OL,10,Fconcerns about parts of the new layout.
OL,12,FFootfall at Bilston's outdoor market
OL,13,Frose by 14% in the first three months
OL,14,Fafter the scheme was completed,
OL,15,Faccording to figures released by the
OL,16,FCity of Wolverhampton Council. More
OL,17,Fthan 570,000 visits were recorded since
OL,18,Ftrading resumed in July and 15 new
OL,19,Ftraders have joined the market.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
