OL,3,GNEWSAVisitor numbers climb after #8m
OL,4,Amarket makeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FFruit and vegetable trader Julie Emery
OL,7,Fsaid the refurbished site had attracted
OL,8,Fboth new and returning customers.
OL,10,F"The new market has brought us lots of
OL,11,Fnew visitors as well as our loyal
OL,12,Fcustomers," she said.
